      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "LinkedIn Live provides a platform for individuals and organizations to broadcast live event content to their network in real time. This video broadcasting feature is currently in beta and available to LinkedIn Members and LinkedIn Pages that meet specific criteria. This specific criteria is to ensure we provide access to existing content creators who have a significant LinkedIn audience and a history of creating quality, professional video content. We also want to ensure that video content sharing happens in a safe and trusted environment on LinkedIn.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "To learn more about requesting access to LinkedIn Live, submit an application here",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "Already have access? Use this API to confirm whether your profile or page have been approved. The response from this will API will determine if you have access to create live videos using the following services: assets, liveVideos, and ugcPosts.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
