      "Text": "URL-decoded person urn: urn:li:person:mvgmS_tF6N\nURL-encoded person urn: urn%3Ali%3Aperson%3AmvgmS_tF6N\nEntity: entity:(member:urn%3Ali%3Aperson%3AmvgmS_tF6N)",
